10. DNS Resolvers & Cryptographic Diagnostics
    - DNS resolution powered by Node.js DNS subsystem (c-ares)
    - Preconfigured public resolvers referenced:
      * Cloudflare DNS (1.1.1.1)
      * Google Public DNS (8.8.8.8)
      * Quad9 DNS (9.9.9.9)
      * Cisco OpenDNS (208.67.222.222)
    - SSL/TLS cryptographic diagnostics powered by Node.js TLS / OpenSSL

11. IEEE OUI & Hardware Vendor Database
    - MAC address vendor prefix allocations compiled from IEEE Standards Association
      (https://standards.ieee.org/) and Wireshark Manuf Database (https://www.wireshark.org/).
    - Used for offline MAC-to-vendor resolution in LAN Scanner.

12. Local Network Discovery & Diagnostic Protocols
    - Implementations based on public IETF and open networking specifications:
      * Multicast DNS (mDNS): RFC 6762
      * DNS-Based Service Discovery (DNS-SD / Bonjour): RFC 6763
      * Simple Service Discovery Protocol (SSDP / UPnP): UPnP Forum / ISO/IEC 29341
      * NetBIOS Name Service (NBNS): RFC 1001 & RFC 1002
      * Link-Local Multicast Name Resolution (LLMNR): RFC 4795
      * Simple Network Management Protocol (SNMP) & MIBs: RFC 1157, RFC 1901, RFC 1213, RFC 3805, RFC 2790

